                <pb facs="0280" n="246" sameAs="frus:frus1870/pg246"/>

                <p>[Inclosures.]</p>
                <p>1. Copy of a resolution of the Senate of the United States, passed February 8,
                    1870.</p>
                <p>2. Translation of the official report of the proceedings at the international
                    monetary conference in Paris in 1867.</p>
                <p>3. Memorandum of the populations of the four groups of countries referred to in
                    this paper.</p>
